      55.17,
      474.3,
      295.22,
      516.66
    ],
    "text": "I, Gayantha Karunatilleke, Minister of Lands and ParliamentaryReforms hereby declare under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of theLand Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for apublic purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.",
    "fonts": [
