      528.3,
      295.21,
      592.26
    ],
    "text": "Under mention land in total extent of About 4.1805 Hectares,depicted in Advance Tracing No. BT/ERP/2017/163 of 23.12.2017prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated at the villages ofKaluvankerny in the Grama Niladhari Division, No. 198A ofKaluvankerny \u2013 02 Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Eravur Pattuin Batticaloa District, in Eastern Province and bounded as follows:",
